{"id":"vod_md_3081","vodId":"3081","provider":"md","providerName":"魔都动漫","type":2,"name":"萝球社！","name_cn":"萝球社！","date":"2011-01-01","year":"2011","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"12集全","images":{"common":"https://www.mdzypic.com/upload/vod/20230823-1/03aff0ace429e907b86cb14d246979da.jpg"},"summary":"由于一次意外，篮球健将长谷川昂（梶裕贵 配音）所隶属的篮球部被暂停活动一年。失去了最心爱的篮球，小昂的生活开始浑浑噩噩起来。经过阿姨篁美星（伊藤静 配音）的介绍，失意的小昂成为了私立慧心学园小学部的篮球教练。当小学部的篮球教练有什么意思？！虽然心有抵触，但小昂还是上岗了。经过了一段时间的训练，小昂曾经瞧不起的女子篮球队居然爆发出了惊人的势力。稳重大气的凑智花（花泽香菜 配音），活泼可爱的三沢真帆（井口裕香 配音），个性爽朗的永冢纱季（日笠阳子 配音），别看她们的身板单薄，但各个都有着出人意料的长项。小昂对于篮球的热情被重新激起了，他们的目标是——向县篮球大赛冠军进发！","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-08-23 08:31:15","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"modum3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第1集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230821/njOBm0GX/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第2集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230821/Oxl7RNtI/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第3集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230821/hIszXmC3/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第4集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230821/e5x8z6xU/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第5集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230821/nPfiNJLL/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第6集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230821/eJRfDyLi/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第7集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230821/eaeWtFFs/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第8集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230821/HBXXpIuX/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第9集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230821/5ZNhNTpo/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230821/OPuZBm4a/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230821/OTgrVTGo/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230821/zYHCU7mb/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T09:36:09.154Z"}